sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant HA as HIS_Country_A
    participant NA as Node_Country_A
    %% participant NBA as Notification Broker A
    %% participant NBB as Notification Broker B
    participant NB as Node_Country_B
    participant HB as HIS_Country_B

    %% Note over NA, NB: Step 0: Subscription

    %% NB->>NBA: ITI 110: Resource Subscription A
    %% NA->>NBB: ITI 110: Resource Subscription B

    Note over HA, HB: Teleconsultation (Doctor to Doctor)
    
    Note over HA, NA: Step 1: Generate Order

    HA->>HA: Create Order
    HA->>NA: Persist ServiceRequest <G>
    NA->>HA: ACK
    HA->>NA: ITI-65: Persist IPS_A <G>
    NA->>HA: ACK
    %% NA->>NBA: ITI 111: Resource Publish A
    %% NBA->>NB: ITI 112: Resource Notify A
    
    Note over NA, HB: Step 2: Teleconsultation Response Country B

    HB->>NB: Check pending ServiceRequests
    NB->>NA: Search for active ServiceRequests <G>
    NA->>NB: Return ServiceRequest
    
    NB->>NA: ITI-68: Retrieve IPS_A <G>
    NA->>NB: Return IPS_A

    NB->>HB: Send ServiceRequest + IPS_A

    
    Note right of HB: Specialist Evaluation
    HB->>HB: Generate Clinical Report
    HB->>NB: ITI-65: Save Report (Consultation Note) <G>
    NB->>HB: ACK

    %% NB->>NBB: ITI 111: Resource Publish B
    %% NBB->>NA: ITI 112: Resource Notify B
    
    Note over HA, NB: Step 3: View Teleconsultation Response Country A

    HA->>NA: Check Report results

    NA->>NB: ITI-67: Search for Report (Consultation Note) <G>
    NB->>NA: Return Document Reference for Report (Consultation Note)
    
    NA->>NB: ITI-68: Retrieve Report (Consultation Note) <G>
    NB->>NA: Return Report (Consultation Note)

    NA->>HA: Send Report (Consultation Note)

    HA->>HA: View Report (Consultation Note)
    Note over HA: Electronic Health Record Update

    HA->>NA: Mark ServiceRequest as completed
    NA->>HA: ACK